HV-01: held-by → ST-01, ST-02, ST-05; party-to → VT-06, VT-07; operationalized-by → M-07, M-09.

HV-02: held-by → ST-01, ST-02; party-to → VT-02; operationalized-by → M-04, M-09; explained-by → HFC-03, HFC-06.

HV-03: held-by → ST-01 to ST-07; party-to → VT-04, VT-05; operationalized-by → M-01, M-09, M-10.

HV-04: held-by → ST-01, ST-04, ST-06, ST-07; party-to → VT-01, VT-06; operationalized-by → M-01, M-06; explained-by → HFC-02.

HV-05: held-by → ST-01 to ST-04, ST-06, ST-07; party-to → VT-03; operationalized-by → M-03; explained-by → HFC-01, HFC-07.

HV-06: held-by → ST-01, ST-02, ST-03, ST-05; party-to → VT-01, VT-02, VT-04, VT-07; operationalized-by → M-02, M-05, M-08; explained-by → HFC-01, HFC-03, HFC-04, HFC-05, HFC-07.

HV-07: held-by → ST-01, ST-03, ST-05; party-to → VT-05; operationalized-by → M-05, M-07; explained-by → HFC-04.

HV-08: held-by → ST-01, ST-03, ST-04, ST-06; party-to → VT-03; operationalized-by → M-09, M-10; explained-by → HFC-08.
